
# Yummy BLT (bacon, lettace, and tomato) Sandwich

## Asumptions
- The robot will already have a knife in it's hand and 2 slices of bread on the counter.
- 3 slices of cooked bacon and one tomato that's on a chopping board lay on the counter also.
- The robot is 5 feet from the middle of the counter to the right where all the food is.
- There is a knife needed to cut the food 3 feet to the left from the middle of the counter.
- The robot will already know how to walk, grab, and the movement of cutting.

## Overview
- Bread (2 slices)
- Bacon (3 slices)
- 1 tomato
- 1 lettace

## Instructions
1. The robot will take five steps forward to the middle of the counter.
2. The robot will now take 3 steps to the left of the middle of the counter.
3. The robot raises its left hand and grabs the knife with its left hand.
4. The robot will walk 3 feet to the right back in the middle of the counter.
5. The robot raises its right arm and grabs the tomato with its right hand and holds it.
6. The robot cuts the tomato with the knife in its left hand cutting it from left to right.
7. The robot cut 6 slices from the tomato and stops.
8. The robot grabs a bread slice with its right hand and lays it in front of it on the counter.
9. The robot grabs 3 tomato sliceswith its right hand.
10. The robot puts the 3 tomato slices on the bread slice.
11. With knife in its left hand the robot grabs all 3 slices of cooked baccon with its right hand.
12. The robot lays the 3 slices of cooked bacon in front of it.
13. The robot holds the bacon with it's right hand as it cuts with it's left hand.
14. The robot cuts the cooked bacon to 20 pieces.
15. The robot stops cutting.
16. The robot grabs the 20 pieces of cut cooked bacon with its right hand.
17. The robot set the 20 pieces of cut cooked bacon on the bread slice with the 3 tomato slices.
18. The robot grabs the lettace with its right hand and puts it in font of it.
19. The robot holds the lettace with its right hand as it cuts with its left.
20. The robot stops cutting after cutting 2 slices of lettace.
21. with it's right hand it grabs the 2 lettace slices.
22. The robot puts the 2 lettace slices on the bread slice with cut up cooked bacon and tomato on it.
23. After letting go of the lettace in its right hand the robot picks up the second bread slice with its right hand.
24. The robot puts the bread slice on top of the other bread slice with 3 tomato slices, 20 cooked cut up bacon slices, and 2 lettace slices on its.
25. The robot puts the knife in its left hand down.
26. The robot made a sandwich.


## Done when
- The robot is done making the sandwich when of the ingrediants are cut, except for the 2 bread slices
- The robot is done and made a sandwich after putting all 2 bread slices, 20 cooked bacon slices, 3 tomato slices, and 2 lettace slices are put on top of each other.
